{"id":"brachte","lemma":"brachte","pos":"verb","rank":843,"glosses":["brought; preterite of bringen, bring."],"ipa":"/ˈbraxtə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1f/De-brachte.ogg/De-brachte.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das brachte uns zusammen.","en":"That's what brought us together.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"together"}]},{"text":"Was brachte dich dazu, das zu sagen?","en":"What made you say that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760411","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"in addition to it"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"}]},{"text":"Ich brachte ihn ins Krankenhaus.","en":"I took him to the hospital.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"him"},{"g":"into the"},{"g":"hospital"}]},{"text":"Es brachte mich zum Nachdenken.","en":"It made me think.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/566295","words":[{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"to think"}]},{"text":"Das brachte meine Mutter zum Weinen.","en":"It made my mother cry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756049","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"to weep, cry"}]}]}